message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SYJ-RE-Workstation"
abstract: "SYJ-RE-Workstation v0.1.0 is an early-stage Bash-based static Android APK inspection workstation. It collects file identity and SHA-256, AAPT package metadata, permissions and manifest output, ZIP archive inventory and optional apksigner/JADX results. Reports include raw evidence files, an evidence-only SUMMARY.md, sanitized tool-versions.txt and a report comparison helper. The repository includes Termux and Debian bootstrap scripts, regression tests, documentation and a static website. CI validates GitHub-hosted Debian 12, Debian 13, Ubuntu 22.04 and Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 containers only; physical Android, Termux itself and Debian PRoot on Android remain unverified until community reports are submitted and reviewed. Not included: APKTool integration, ELF/native inspection, DEX structural analysis, JSON/HTML report exports, YARA scanning or dynamic analysis."
